* Digital I/O stages (project-authored, simplified). Every logic IC in the library is built from XSPICE digital code models
* (d_*) inside a subcircuit; these stages connect those digital nodes to ordinary analog pins.
* The supply pins set the logic levels: input thresholds and output levels scale with (vc - gn). The supply draws no current.
*
* bench_din vc gn a d: input stage. The pin voltage is normalised to (V(a)-V(gn)) / (RK*(V(vc)-V(gn)) + AK), then an
*   adc_bridge reads it: below LO is 0, above HI is 1, in between is unknown (X). RK=1, AK=0: thresholds are fractions of the
*   supply (CMOS); RK=0, AK=1: thresholds are volts above gn (TTL). INV=1 inverts (for active-low pins). PU=1 pulls an unconnected
*   pin to vc through 1 Gohm instead of to gn (used for active-low control pins, so that an unwired one is inactive).
* bench_dout vc gn d y: output stage. A dac_bridge drives a node that a polynomial source scales to
*   gn + (VOLF + (VOHF-VOLF)*d) * (vc - gn), followed by ROUT in series (the output impedance). An unknown (X) state drives mid-level.
* bench_dout3 vc gn d en y: the same, behind a switch that opens while the digital enable en is 0 (high impedance: 1 Gohm to gn).
* bench_dsch vc gn a d: Schmitt-trigger input. d is 1 above VP (fraction of the supply) and 0 below VN; between them it keeps its state.
*   The hysteresis is a voltage-controlled switch on the normalised input.
.subckt bench_din vc gn a d params: LO=0.45 HI=0.55 RK=1 AK=0 INV=0 PU=0 TD=1n
Epr pr gn vc gn {PU}
Rin a pr 1g
Bn n 0 V=(1-2*INV)*(V(a)-V(gn))/(RK*max(V(vc)-V(gn),0.1)+AK)+INV
Rn n 0 1g
A1 [n] [d] adc
.model adc adc_bridge(in_low={LO} in_high={HI} rise_delay={TD} fall_delay={TD})
.ends bench_din
.subckt bench_dout vc gn d y params: VOLF=0 VOHF=1 ROUT=45 TD=1n
A1 [d] [dn] dac
.model dac dac_bridge(out_low=0 out_high=1 out_undef=0.5 t_rise={TD} t_fall={TD})
Rdn dn 0 1g
Eo mid gn POLY(2) dn 0 vc gn 0 0 {VOLF} 0 {VOHF-VOLF}
Ro mid y {ROUT}
.ends bench_dout
.subckt bench_dout3 vc gn d en y params: VOLF=0 VOHF=1 ROUT=45 TD=1n
Xo vc gn d ya bench_dout VOLF={VOLF} VOHF={VOHF} ROUT={ROUT} TD={TD}
A1 [en] [enn] dac
.model dac dac_bridge(out_low=0 out_high=1 out_undef=0 t_rise={TD} t_fall={TD})
Ren enn 0 1g
S1 ya y enn 0 oe
.model oe SW(VT=0.5 VH=0.1 RON=1m ROFF=1g)
Rz y gn 1g
.ends bench_dout3
.subckt bench_dsch vc gn a d params: VP=0.6 VN=0.38 TD=1n
Rin a gn 1g
Bn n 0 V=(V(a)-V(gn))/max(V(vc)-V(gn),0.1)
Rn n 0 1g
Vh h 0 1
Rh q h 1k
S1 q 0 0 n sch
.model sch SW(VT={-(VP+VN)/2} VH={(VP-VN)/2} RON=1 ROFF=1g)
A1 [q] [d] adc
.model adc adc_bridge(in_low=0.5 in_high=0.5 rise_delay={TD} fall_delay={TD})
.ends bench_dsch
